   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Almost every design mistake here comes from treating them as one system. So the design is really three designs that share a\nclient - and the interesting engineering is in noticing which one needs what.",
   "originalText": "Almost every design mistake here comes from treating them as one system. So the design is really three designs that share a\nclient - and the interesting engineering is in noticing which one needs what.",
