   "versionNonce": 700301,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "(21, 300000, 400000) -+\n(21, 300001, 400000) -+->  hash 3f8a...  ->  ONE stored object ('empty ocean')\n(21, 300002, 400000) -+",
   "originalText": "(21, 300000, 400000) -+\n(21, 300001, 400000) -+->  hash 3f8a...  ->  ONE stored object ('empty ocean')\n(21, 300002, 400000) -+",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "dedup",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 850,
   "y": 606,
   "width": 599,
   "height": 105,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100044,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700308,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "And the 60 PB compresses enormously, because most of the Earth is ocean, desert,\nice or unbroken forest - vast regions where adjacent high-zoom tiles are\nBYTE-IDENTICAL. Store one blue tile and reference it billions of times, and real\nstorage drops by orders of magnitude.\n\nRecognising that the naive 60 PB is a CEILING rather than an estimate is the\nuseful move; quoting it as the answer is not.",
   "originalText": "And the 60 PB compresses enormously, because most of the Earth is ocean, desert,\nice or unbroken forest - vast regions where adjacent high-zoom tiles are\nBYTE-IDENTICAL. Store one blue tile and reference it billions of times, and real\nstorage drops by orders of magnitude.\n\nRecognising that the naive 60 PB is a CEILING rather than an estimate is the\nuseful move; quoting it as the answer is not.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
