   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "the server has taken the batch and will process it\nasynchronously; it makes no promise the samples were\nstored. The honest status code for a fire-and-forget\nwrite, and it lets the ingest path acknowledge before\ntouching Cassandra or Kafka.",
   "originalText": "the server has taken the batch and will process it\nasynchronously; it makes no promise the samples were\nstored. The honest status code for a fire-and-forget\nwrite, and it lets the ingest path acknowledge before\ntouching Cassandra or Kafka.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
